#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/annotations/index.rst:66
msgid ""
"When set, this value is passed as the second argument of "
"``__launch_bounds__(maxThreadsPerBlock, minBlocksPerMultiprocessor)`` in the "
"generated CUDA kernel.  A larger value hints the compiler to limit register "
"usage so that more blocks can reside on each SM simultaneously, which can "
"improve occupancy at the cost of potentially more register spilling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/annotations/index.rst:74
